) VALUES (
    'Chhatarpur Farms',
    'chhatarpur-farms',
    'Chhatarpur Farms: Delhi’s Premier Country Estates & Luxury Farmhouses',
    'Sprawling across South Delhi’s pristine low-density green corridors, Chhatarpur Farms represents the pinnacle of private acreage living, palatial country mansions, and generational family retreats.',
    'Territory Monograph 13 · South Delhi Country Estates',
    '[{\"label\":\"Prevailing Rate\",\"value\":\"₹8,500–₹16,000 / Sq. Yd.\"},{\"label\":\"Plot Footprint\",\"value\":\"1–5+ Acres (4,840–24,200+ Sq. Yds)\"},{\"label\":\"Zoning Status\",\"value\":\"LDRA / Green Belt\"},{\"label\":\"Privacy Profile\",\"value\":\"Gated Private Estates\"}]',
    'Delhi’s foremost luxury farmhouse destination, renowned for gated acreage estates, private swimming pavilions, equestrian facilities, and uncompromised green privacy.',
    'Chhatarpur Farms stands as the undisputed jewel in South Delhi’s luxury farmhouse landscape. Stretching across scenic countryside corridors flanked by the Southern Ridge and Asola sanctuaries, this exclusive territory is synonymous with India’s elite industrialists, prominent business dynasties, high-ranking diplomats, and private wealth principals seeking expansive green acreage, uncompromised seclusion, and bespoke architectural grandeur.',
    '[\"Gated Low-Density Residential Acreage (LDRA)\",\"Expansive 1 to 5+ Acre Private Landholdings\",\"Private Swimming Pavilions & Formal Lawns\",\"Enduring Inter-Generational Family Wealth Preservation\"]',
    'Covering scenic corridors such as Radhey Mohan Drive, DLF Farms, and the Mandi Road green belt, Chhatarpur Farms provides an unmatched refuge from urban density while remaining minutes away from South Delhi’s diplomatic and retail nerve centers. Each estate is characterized by gated entry gates, tree-lined internal avenues, private swimming pools, party lawns accommodating hundreds of guests, dedicated staff accommodations, and organic horticulture plots. The Low-Density Residential Area (LDRA) regulations under the Delhi Master Plan ensure that the area preserves its pristine ecological character and low population density in perpetuity.',
    'The Chhatarpur Farms property market is characterized by ultra-rare off-market transactions and exceptional capital stability. Built farmhouse estates on 1 to 2.5 acres typically range from ₹35 Cr to ₹75 Cr, while premier 4 to 5+ acre manorial estates command ₹90 Cr to ₹160 Cr+ depending on arterial road frontage, boundary perimeter quality, and architectural vintage. Unbuilt agricultural / LDRA land parcels trade on an acreage basis ranging between ₹8,500 and ₹16,000 per sq. yard. Institutional investors, multi-generational family offices, and foreign missions frequently lease these estates for long-term diplomatic retreats and private executive entertainment, generating substantial annual yields.',
    'Acquiring country estates in Chhatarpur Farms requires specialized fiduciary due diligence. Elite Homez conducts exhaustive 30-year revenue record title verifications (Khasra/Khatauni inspections), LDRA compliance audits, groundwater extraction clearances, boundary wall demarcation surveys, and municipal no-encumbrance certifications prior to mandate initiation.',
    '[{\"title\":\"Palatial Country Mansions & Villas\",\"description\":\"Expansive architectural estates offering 12,000 to 35,000 sq.ft. of built luxury, double-height grand salons, private elevators, heated swimming pools, formal banquet lawns, and extensive staff quarters.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"Prominent Industrialists, Multi-Generational Family Dynasties & Celebrated Entrepreneurs\",\"cta_text\":\"Inquire About Mansions\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Farms+Country+Mansion+Advisory\"},{\"title\":\"Boutique 1-Acre Modern Farmhouses\",\"description\":\"Contemporary luxury retreats designed by leading architects, featuring open-plan minimalist layouts, seamless indoor-outdoor courtyards, plunge pools, smart home automation, and organic kitchen gardens.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"New-Economy Founders, Tech Leaders, Creative Directors & Discerning HNIs\",\"cta_text\":\"Explore 1-Acre Retreats\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Farms+1-Acre+Retreat+Advisory\"},{\"title\":\"Prime Freehold LDRA Land Parcels\",\"description\":\"Clear-title acreage land parcels ranging from 1 to 5+ acres permitting bespoke residential farmhouse construction under LDRA master plan guidelines, ideal for custom generational masterworks.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"Visionary Builders, Legacy Land Investors & Private Wealth Principals\",\"cta_text\":\"View Acreage Parcels\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Farms+Land+Parcel+Mandate\"}]',
    'Estate Asset Categories',
    'Typical Property Formats in Chhatarpur Farms',
    '[{\"type\":\"Boutique Farmhouse Parcel\",\"size\":\"1 Acre (~4,840 Sq. Yards / ~43,560 Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"The standard luxury entry footprint, accommodating a 10,000–14,000 sq.ft. luxury villa, private swimming pool, 3-car garage, and manicured lawns.\"},{\"type\":\"Standard Country Estate Parcel\",\"size\":\"2.5 Acres (~12,100 Sq. Yards / ~1,08,900 Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"The most sought-after signature estate dimension, accommodating grand sprawling villas, guest cottages, tennis court/sports pavilion, and extensive landscaped grounds.\"},{\"type\":\"Sprawling Manorial Holding\",\"size\":\"5+ Acres (~24,200+ Sq. Yards / ~2,17,800+ Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"Generational country compounds featuring private access drives, full equestrian paddocks, private lakes or water bodies, banquet pavilions, and independent guard houses.\"}]',
    'Spatial Typologies',
    'Typical Residential Plot Sizes in Chhatarpur Farms',
    'Land parcels in Chhatarpur Farms are configured in generous acre multiples under the Delhi Master Plan’s Low-Density Residential Area (LDRA) framework, guaranteeing low ground coverage, extensive setbacks, and unmatched tree canopy coverage.',
    'Life in Chhatarpur Farms offers an idyllic country lifestyle within metropolitan Delhi. Mornings begin with birdcalls from the adjacent Asola wildlife reserve, horseback riding along private equestrian paths, and organic breakfasts harvested directly from on-site gardens. Evenings host elite poolside gatherings, wine-tasting dinners, and private concerts hosted in secluded amphitheaters away from city scrutiny.',
    'Neighborhood Ambiance',
    'Lifestyle & Community in Chhatarpur Farms',
    'The Chhatarpur Farms real estate ecosystem is deeply confidential and primarily off-market. Elite Homez manages exclusive mandates representing buyers and sellers in complete discretion.',
    'Arterial Transit & Strategic Corridors:\nStrategically located in South Delhi with rapid arterial connections:\n- Mehrauli-Gurgaon (MG) Road: 5 minutes drive providing seamless access to Qutab Minar and DLF Cyber City.\n- Chhatarpur Metro Station (Yellow Line): 7 minutes drive connecting directly to Connaught Place and Central Delhi.\n- Mandi Road Corridor: Direct bypass connection to Golf Course Road and Gurgaon commercial corridors.\n- IGI International Airport: 20–25 minutes via Vasant Kunj / Mahipalpur flyover link.\n- South Delhi Luxury Hubs: 12 minutes to DLF Emporio and Promenade luxury shopping precincts.',
    'Arterial Infrastructure',
    'Connectivity & Transit Links',
    'Asola Bhatti Wildlife Sanctuary, Radhey Mohan Drive, DLF Farms, Chhatarpur Temple, Tivoli Garden Resort, Vasant Kunj Emporio',
    '[{\"name\":\"The Heritage School\",\"type\":\"Progressive Experiential / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Ranked among top experiential educational institutions in Delhi NCR.\"},{\"name\":\"Vasant Valley School\",\"type\":\"Premier Co-Ed / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~15 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Consistently ranked among the nation’s foremost academic institutions.\"},{\"name\":\"The British School New Delhi\",\"type\":\"International / IB & IGCSE\",\"location\":\"Chanakyapuri (~25 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Gold standard international diplomatic curriculum accessible via direct corridor.\"},{\"name\":\"Pathways School Gurgaon\",\"type\":\"IB World School\",\"location\":\"Mandi Road Corridor (~18 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Sprawling international campus easily reached via the scenic Mandi-Gwal Pahari link.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"Fortis Flt. Lt. Rajan Dhall Hospital\",\"type\":\"Multi-Specialty Tertiary Care\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"JCI accredited comprehensive surgical, cardiac, and emergency trauma center.\"},{\"name\":\"Institute of Liver and Biliary Sciences (ILBS)\",\"type\":\"Autonomous Super-Specialty Institute\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~10 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"World-renowned medical and research center with state-of-the-art facilities.\"},{\"name\":\"Max Super Speciality Hospital Saket\",\"type\":\"Quaternary Healthcare Hub\",\"location\":\"Press Enclave Road (~18 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Premier multi-specialty healthcare institution with comprehensive robotic surgery.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"DLF Emporio & Promenade\",\"type\":\"Ultra-Luxury Couture & Fine Dining\",\"highlight\":\"Global fashion luxury houses including Louis Vuitton, Gucci, Dior, and Hermès just 12 minutes away.\"},{\"name\":\"The Dhan Mill Compound\",\"type\":\"Curated Design & Artisanal Lifestyle\",\"highlight\":\"Elite designer concept stores, specialty coffee roasters, and gourmet cafes 8 minutes away.\"},{\"name\":\"MG Road Luxury Furniture Boulevard\",\"type\":\"High-End Interior & Art Galleries\",\"highlight\":\"International architectural furniture showrooms and interior design ateliers along the corridor.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"Qutab Golf Course\",\"type\":\"Public Championship Course\",\"highlight\":\"18-hole green sanctuary with stunning views of the historic Qutab Minar tower.\"},{\"name\":\"Asola Nature Reserves & Cycling Trails\",\"type\":\"Protected Biodiversity Sanctuary\",\"highlight\":\"Hundreds of acres of untouched woodland offering mountain biking, nature walks, and birdwatching.\"},{\"name\":\"Delhi Polo Club & Equestrian Stables\",\"type\":\"Equestrian Center\",\"highlight\":\"Private horse riding, show jumping, and polo facilities situated throughout the farmhouse belt.\"}]',
    'When acquiring a luxury farmhouse in Chhatarpur Farms, buyers should ensure boundary perimeter survey accuracy, verify low-density residential zoning notifications, confirm clear agricultural/freehold land revenue titles, and validate municipal road setback compliance.',
    'Chhatarpur Farms commands substantial rental demand from diplomatic missions, Fortune 500 corporate chairpersons, and multinational retreat organizers, yielding attractive annual cash flows alongside generational land appreciation.',
    'Elite Homez maintains direct, confidential relationships with premier landholders and legacy families in Chhatarpur Farms, unlocking off-market estates unavailable through commercial real estate channels.',
    'Elite Homez Country Estate Office',
    'Confidential Country Acreage Mandates.',
    'Whether seeking a turnkey 5-acre manorial estate with private pool and manicured lawns or a pristine 1-acre plot for architectural realization, our private advisory desk represents discerning principals with complete discretion.',
    'Initiate Farmhouse Mandate',
    '/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Farms+Confidential+Acreage+Advisory',
    'Call Advisory Desk',
    'tel:+919811044200',
    '[{\"question\":\"What is the Low-Density Residential Area (LDRA) policy governing Chhatarpur Farms?\",\"answer\":\"Under the Master Plan for Delhi, specified green villages including Chhatarpur are designated as Low-Density Residential Areas (LDRA). This policy permits planned farmhouse construction with restricted ground coverage (typically 15% to 20%), generous green landscape setbacks, and maximum 2 to 3 habitable floors, preserving the serene countryside environment and protecting against dense urban encroachment.\"},{\"question\":\"What are the prevailing land rates and price brackets for farmhouses in Chhatarpur Farms in 2026?\",\"answer\":\"In 2026, land rates in Chhatarpur Farms typically range from ₹8,500 to ₹16,000 per sq. yard on an acreage basis, depending on access road width, gated society status, and proximity to main arterial roads. Turnkey 1-acre designer farmhouses start from ₹35 Cr to ₹55 Cr, while grand 2.5 to 5+ acre country mansions command ₹75 Cr to ₹160 Cr+.\"},{\"question\":\"How clear and secure are land titles in Chhatarpur Farms?\",\"answer\":\"Prime landholdings in Chhatarpur Farms are held under clear freehold revenue titles (registered Sale Deeds with Khatauni/Khasra mutation in the Delhi Revenue Department). Elite Homez conducts 30-year historical title searches, verifies revenue mutations, and validates boundary survey maps to ensure 100% encumbrance-free ownership.\"},{\"question\":\"What security measures are implemented in Chhatarpur Farms?\",\"answer\":\"Most luxury farmhouses are situated within established gated lanes and private drives (such as Radhey Mohan Drive, DLF Farms, and Silver Oak) featuring 24/7 manned security checkpoints, automated boom barriers, CCTV perimeter monitoring, and private security guards deployed across estate perimeters.\"},{\"question\":\"How accessible is Chhatarpur Farms to Gurgaon and Central Delhi?\",\"answer\":\"Chhatarpur Farms offers exceptional dual-city transit connectivity. Via MG Road and the Mandi-Gwal Pahari corridor, DLF Cyber City and Golf Course Road in Gurugram are reached within 15–20 minutes. Central Delhi and Chanakyapuri are accessible in 25–30 minutes via Mehrauli-Badarpur Road and Sri Aurobindo Marg, or via the direct Yellow Line Metro from Chhatarpur Station.\"}]',
    'Local Estate Insights',
    'Frequently Asked Questions: Chhatarpur Farms',
    '/assets/images/areas/chhatarpur-farms.jpg',
    'Luxury country estate and private farmhouse in Chhatarpur Farms, South Delhi',
    'Fiduciary Client Representation',
    'Begin Your Farmhouse Acquisition in Chhatarpur Farms',
    'Whether seeking an off-market generational acreage estate or a modern 1-acre country villa, Elite Homez provides confidential representation, verified titles, and bespoke transaction advisory.',
