    'Chhatarpur Farms Luxury Country Estates & Farmhouses | Elite Homez',
    'Explore verified 1 to 5+ acre luxury farmhouses and country estates for sale in Chhatarpur Farms, South Delhi. Confidential off-market advisory with Elite Homez.',
    'Discover ultra-luxury farmhouses and country estates for sale in Chhatarpur Farms, South Delhi. Explore 1 to 5+ acre gated estates with private pools, lush grounds & clear titles.'
