) VALUES (
    'Chhatarpur',
    'chhatarpur',
    'Chhatarpur: Contemporary Luxury Residences & Builder Floors in South Delhi',
    'Bridging South Delhi’s heritage corridors with Gurugram’s commercial hubs, Chhatarpur offers premier luxury builder floors, gated boutique enclaves, and exceptional transit connectivity.',
    'Territory Monograph 14 · South Delhi Growth Corridor',
    '[{\"label\":\"Prevailing Rate\",\"value\":\"₹14,000–₹24,000 / Sq. Ft.\"},{\"label\":\"Floor Typologies\",\"value\":\"3 & 4 BHK Luxury Floors\"},{\"label\":\"Metro Access\",\"value\":\"Yellow Line Direct Access\"},{\"label\":\"Rental Yield\",\"value\":\"4.2%–5.8% Gross Yield\"}]',
    'A vibrant South Delhi residential enclave featuring spacious luxury builder floors, gated boutique societies, excellent metro connectivity, and immediate access to Saket and Vasant Kunj.',
    'Chhatarpur has rapidly emerged as one of South Delhi’s most dynamic residential destinations, offering sophisticated contemporary urban living without the prohibitive price thresholds of classic diplomatic colonies. Centered around iconic green ridges and major transit arteries, the neighborhood is celebrated for modern full-floor luxury residences, gated private colonies, burgeoning artisanal culinary avenues, and unbeatable proximity to both Central Delhi and Gurugram.',
    '[\"Gated Residential Colonies & Private Enclaves\",\"Spacious 3 & 4 BHK Luxury Builder Floors\",\"Direct Yellow Line Metro Transit Access\",\"Immediate Proximity to Saket, Vasant Kunj & Cyber City\"]',
    'Modern residential development in Chhatarpur is concentrated in well-planned gated enclaves such as Chhatarpur Enclave, Dr. Ambedkar Colony, and residential sectors adjoining the 100 Feet Road corridor. Contemporary builder floor developments in this sector showcase high-specification marble flooring, imported Italian fittings, modular open-concept kitchens, private stilt parking with EV charging provisions, dedicated high-speed elevators, and exclusive private rooftop terraces. The area’s unique topography provides residents with expansive panoramic vistas of the Southern Ridge canopy while offering immediate walkability to neighborhood markets, organic grocers, and fitness centers.',
    'The Chhatarpur residential property market delivers compelling value and solid capital appreciation within South Delhi. Well-appointed 3 BHK luxury builder floors typically trade between ₹1.25 Cr and ₹2.25 Cr, while expansive 4 BHK and duplex penthouses command ₹2.50 Cr to ₹5.50 Cr+. Independent residential bungalows and plots in established societies range from ₹5 Cr to ₹18 Cr+. Due to the immediate proximity of the Chhatarpur and Qutab Minar metro stations, rental yields in Chhatarpur consistently outperform traditional South Delhi enclaves, achieving 4.2% to 5.8% gross rental returns driven by continuous corporate executive leasing demand.',
    'Due to varying land tenure classifications across Chhatarpur, discerning buyers must exercise thorough legal due diligence. Elite Homez strictly curates residences with verified Registry ownership, authenticated sub-registrar conveyance deeds, sanctioned building plans, independent electricity/water connections, and clear municipal tax clearance receipts.',
    '[{\"title\":\"Designer Luxury Builder Floors\",\"description\":\"Spacious 3 and 4 BHK single-floor residences offering full-floor independence, private elevator landings, designer modular kitchens, Italian marble flooring, and dedicated covered stilt parking.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"Corporate Executives, Modern Families, Doctors, Legal Professionals & Discerning HNIs\",\"cta_text\":\"Inquire About Floors\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Luxury+Builder+Floor+Advisory\"},{\"title\":\"Terrace Penthouses & Duplex Residences\",\"description\":\"Top-floor luxury duplexes featuring private landscaped terrace gardens, panoramic ridge views, outdoor entertainment decks, double-height living spaces, and dedicated servant quarters.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"Entrepreneurs, Senior Executives & Lifestyle Investors\",\"cta_text\":\"Explore Penthouses\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Penthouse+Advisory\"},{\"title\":\"Independent Residential Houses & Plots\",\"description\":\"Freehold residential land parcels and standalone houses in gated colonies permitting multi-story redevelopment with Stilt + 4 floor construction potential.\",\"buyer_profile\":\"Multi-Generational Families & Long-Term Real Estate Investors\",\"cta_text\":\"View Houses & Plots\",\"cta_link\":\"/contact-us?subject=Chhatarpur+Independent+House+Mandate\"}]',
    'Residential Asset Categories',
    'Typical Property Formats in Chhatarpur',
    '[{\"type\":\"Compact Luxury Floor Footprint\",\"size\":\"100–180 Sq. Yards (~900–1,620 Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"Highly functional 2 & 3 BHK luxury builder floor layouts favored by young professionals and families seeking prime South Delhi residency.\"},{\"type\":\"Spacious Family Floor Plate\",\"size\":\"200–350 Sq. Yards (~1,800–3,150 Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"Premium 3 & 4 BHK luxury residences featuring expansive formal living areas, utility rooms, multi-car parking, and servant accommodations.\"},{\"type\":\"Grand Enclave Plot & Estate\",\"size\":\"400–1,000+ Sq. Yards (~3,600–9,000+ Sq. Ft.)\",\"description\":\"Substantial standalone residential parcels suited for independent multi-family mansions or high-end boutique residential redevelopment.\"}]',
    'Spatial Typologies',
    'Typical Residential Plot Sizes in Chhatarpur',
    'Residential plots in Chhatarpur accommodate contemporary builder floor developments with wide frontage, dedicated stilt level parking, and vertical elevator access conforming to South Delhi municipal building norms.',
    'Chhatarpur offers an engaging urban lifestyle blending cultural heritage with contemporary chic. Residents enjoy weekend brunches at The Dhan Mill Compound, artisanal cafes on 100 Feet Road, evening jogs in the Garden of Five Senses, and effortless shopping runs to Select CITYWALK and DLF Avenue in Saket.',
    'Neighborhood Ambiance',
    'Lifestyle & Community in Chhatarpur',
    'The Chhatarpur residential market delivers exceptional modern living value with strong capital appreciation and consistent high rental returns across South Delhi.',
    'Arterial Transit & Strategic Corridors:\nExceptional multi-modal transit connectivity across South Delhi and NCR:\n- Chhatarpur Metro Station (Yellow Line): Direct access connecting to Saket (4 mins), AIIMS (14 mins), and Connaught Place (22 mins).\n- Qutab Minar Metro Station: 5 minutes away providing seamless dual-station access.\n- 100 Feet Road: Primary arterial connector linking directly to Vasant Kunj and Mehrauli within 8 minutes.\n- Mehrauli-Badarpur (MB) Road: 5 minutes away connecting to Saket District Centre and South Delhi institutional areas.\n- Mehrauli-Gurgaon (MG) Road: Direct arterial corridor to DLF Cyber City and Gurugram commercial hubs in 18 minutes.\n- IGI Airport: 20 minutes via the Vasant Kunj bypass and Mahipalpur underpass.',
    'Arterial Infrastructure',
    'Connectivity & Transit Links',
    'Chhatarpur Temple Complex, The Dhan Mill Compound, Qutab Minar, Garden of Five Senses, 100 Feet Road Retail Corridor, Tivoli Garden',
    '[{\"name\":\"DPS International Saket\",\"type\":\"International / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Saket (~10 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Renowned international institution offering holistic academic development.\"},{\"name\":\"The Heritage School\",\"type\":\"Progressive Experiential / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Leading experiential academy celebrated for student-centric learning.\"},{\"name\":\"St. Mary’s School\",\"type\":\"Co-Ed Elite / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Madam Sara Mathew Lane (~8 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Prestigious long-standing school known for high academic and athletic standards.\"},{\"name\":\"Gyan Bharati School\",\"type\":\"Senior Secondary / CBSE\",\"location\":\"Saket (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Established academic institution with extensive sports and cultural infrastructure.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"Fortis Hospital Vasant Kunj\",\"type\":\"Multi-Specialty Tertiary Care\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"JCI accredited tertiary hospital with world-class medical and surgical departments.\"},{\"name\":\"Max Super Speciality Hospital Saket\",\"type\":\"Quaternary Healthcare Hub\",\"location\":\"Saket (~14 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"One of Northern India’s foremost multi-specialty healthcare and trauma hubs.\"},{\"name\":\"Apex Multispeciality Hospital\",\"type\":\"Local Multi-Specialty Center\",\"location\":\"Chhatarpur (~4 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Immediate 24/7 emergency, pediatric, and general surgical medical care.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"The Dhan Mill Compound\",\"type\":\"Curated Designer Hub & Cafes\",\"highlight\":\"Boutique fashion studios, specialty dining, patisseries, and contemporary art galleries located right in Chhatarpur.\"},{\"name\":\"Select CITYWALK & DLF Avenue Saket\",\"type\":\"Premier Shopping Malls & Cinemas\",\"highlight\":\"International fashion retail brands, IMAX multiplexes, and fine dining just 12 minutes away.\"},{\"name\":\"100 Feet Road High-Street Precinct\",\"type\":\"Local High-Street & Organic Markets\",\"highlight\":\"Daily premium gourmet shopping, fitness gyms, banks, and lifestyle retail stores within walking distance.\"}]',
    '[{\"name\":\"The Dhan Mill Lifestyle Precinct\",\"type\":\"Artisanal Dining & Pet-Friendly Park\",\"highlight\":\"Delhi’s favorite designer and dining sanctuary featuring open courtyards and gourmet eateries.\"},{\"name\":\"Garden of Five Senses\",\"type\":\"Scenic Botanical Park\",\"highlight\":\"Sprawling 20-acre landscaped park with nature trails, rock sculptures, and seasonal floral exhibitions.\"},{\"name\":\"Qutab Golf Course\",\"type\":\"Public Championship Course\",\"highlight\":\"18-hole championship greens situated against the silhouette of the Qutab Minar monument.\"}]',
