    'tel:+919811044200',
    '[{\"question\":\"Are properties in Chhatarpur registered with clear sale deeds (Registry)?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. While Chhatarpur historically had various land documentations, prime modern luxury builder floors in established enclaves are 100% Freehold and registered with the competent Sub-Registrar Office via clear Conveyance / Sale Deeds. Elite Homez exclusively represents properties with verified Registry documentation, clear chain of title, and sanctioned utilities.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the price range for 3 BHK and 4 BHK luxury builder floors in Chhatarpur?\",\"answer\":\"In 2026, newly constructed 3 BHK luxury builder floors in prime Chhatarpur enclaves range from ₹1.25 Cr to ₹2.25 Cr depending on floor plate size, road width, and interior specifications. Ultra-luxury 4 BHK residences and duplex penthouses with private terrace decks range from ₹2.50 Cr to ₹5.50 Cr+.\"},{\"question\":\"How convenient is metro connectivity from Chhatarpur?\",\"answer\":\"Chhatarpur is exceptionally well-served by the Delhi Metro Yellow Line. The Chhatarpur and Qutab Minar Metro Stations are located within 3 to 7 minutes of most residential enclaves, offering direct non-stop transit to Saket (4 mins), AIIMS (14 mins), Connaught Place (22 mins), and Gurgaon Cyber City (via interchange at Sikanderpur in 20 mins).\"},{\"question\":\"What rental yields can property investors expect in Chhatarpur?\",\"answer\":\"Due to sustained tenant demand from corporate professionals employed in Gurgaon, Saket District Centre, and Aerocity, Chhatarpur delivers above-average rental yields ranging from 4.2% to 5.8% gross annually, alongside steady long-term capital appreciation.\"},{\"question\":\"What amenities and infrastructure are available in modern builder floors in Chhatarpur?\",\"answer\":\"Modern luxury builder floors in Chhatarpur feature full stilt-level covered parking, automated passenger elevators, 100% power backup provisions, modular Italian kitchens, branded VRV air-conditioning provisions, gated CCTV surveillance, and dedicated staff/storage quarters.\"}]',
